  "briefing": "The shaft mouth is in the clinic yard, the open ground inside the compound's west wall. That is what I have, and it is all of what I have. Take the yard and hold it fifteen seconds with nothing of theirs in it, then stand the engineers beside the route and bring it down. Six minutes for the shaft. Six people are in the forecourt south of the clinic, and they walk out through the south gate once one of ours is within four tiles. A firing position covers that gate from the south-west. Walk five of them to the refuge by the checkpoint inside five minutes. People first or yard first is yours to choose; the yard first stops the crews coming up under you. Their east position is three tiles off the clinic's wall. Every heavy round that misses it lands beside the clinic and is billed. The rifles and the Lavi's coax are free beside that wall; its gun, the Namer's cannon and the AT missile are not. Lose the clinic and you have spent more than ten Conduct in one go, which is the mission.",
  "debrief": {
    "victory": {
      "speaker": "idit",
      "text": "The shaft is down and the clinic is standing, and the walk out of the forecourt was the part that counted. The yard had a hole in it, and now it is a yard."
    },
    "defeat": {
      "speaker": "shai",
      "text": "We came off that compound without the job done. The yard is somebody else's again, and so is whatever is under it."
    }
  },
